OL,3,GNEWSAPhotography captures candid
OL,4,Amoments on the Metro
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn online photography exhibition has
OL,7,Fcaptured everyday life on the Tyne and
OL,8,FWear Metro.
OL,10,FTerminus, by Newcastle-based
OL,11,Fdocumentary photographer Sasha Mallo
OL,12,FTardiveau, chronicled the final two
OL,13,Fyears that the original train fleet was
OL,14,Frunning across the north-east of
OL,15,FEngland.
OL,17,FMallo Tardiveau spent many hours
OL,18,Ftravelling on the system between 2024
OL,19,Fand 2026 - as the new Metro trains
OL,20,Freplaced the old ones - meeting people
OL,21,Fand taking their pictures.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
