OL,3,GNEWSAPhotography captures candid
OL,4,Amoments on the Metro
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe said people were "at the heart of
OL,7,Fthis project", adding the project was
OL,8,Fabout "things that seem mundane, but
OL,9,Fwhen you see the photo of that moment,
OL,10,Fit tells a story".
